WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,900
It's a pound or two cents for a shop owner. It's so cheap.

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,500
Chicken feet are still a good deal

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:15,820
The chicken feet on the boulder just now weigh about five kilograms.

4
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:17,420
Although the output is not much

5
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:19,820
But the price of this thing is high, so I can accept it

6
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:29,740
Found a total of five useful pieces of glue.

7
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:32,340
A total of about thirty-five kilograms of sea chicken feet were obtained.

8
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:41,290
It's a pity that the tide is beginning to rise. We can't take any more risks.

9
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:43,290
Today’s harvest totaled more than 400 kilograms of prawns.

10
00:00:43,290 --> 00:00:45,290
More than thirty pounds of sea chicken feet

11
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:47,290
The distance from the iron boat is one step closer

12
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:49,850
Need to ship quickly

13
00:00:49,850 --> 00:00:51,380
Although there is ice on the ship

14
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:53,180
I also applied sunscreen treatment

15
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:55,180
But some prawns have been out of water for too long

16
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:57,180
It will still become less vivid
